---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Speech-to-Text - Adventa">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Speech-to-Text Solutions</h1>
      <p>State-of-the-art speech recognition technology for transcription and voice interfaces.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>What We Offer</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Advanced speech recognition solutions for diverse applications</p>
      
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Real-time Transcription</h3>
          <p>Our real-time speech-to-text solutions provide instant transcription with high accuracy. Perfect for live captions, meeting transcription, and voice-enabled applications.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Voice Command Systems</h3>
          <p>Enable hands-free control with our voice command solutions. We build custom voice interfaces that understand natural language and execute commands accurately.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Meeting Transcription</h3>
          <p>Automatically transcribe meetings with speaker identification. Our solutions capture every word, making it easy to search, review, and share meeting content.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Accessibility Solutions</h3>
          <p>Make your content accessible to everyone. Our speech-to-text solutions provide real-time captions for live events, videos, and applications, ensuring compliance with accessibility standards.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Custom Model Training</h3>
          <p>Need higher accuracy for specific domains or languages? We train custom speech recognition models tailored to your industry terminology, accent, or language requirements.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>API Integration</h3>
          <p>Integrate speech recognition into your existing applications with our robust APIs. We provide comprehensive documentation and support to ensure smooth integration.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Technology & Accuracy</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Built on cutting-edge deep learning models</p>
      <div class="card" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">
          Our speech-to-text solutions are powered by state-of-the-art deep learning models, including transformer-based architectures and end-to-end speech recognition systems. We achieve industry-leading accuracy across multiple languages and domains.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 1rem;">
          Whether you need cloud-based processing for scalability or on-premise deployment for privacy and low latency, we have solutions that fit your requirements. Our systems support multiple languages and can be fine-tuned for specific use cases.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>